.TH "CSSTRANSFORMVALUE.LENGTH" "3JS" "September 10, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSTransformValue.length \- CSSTransformValue: length property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]length\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]CSSTransformValue\f[R] interface returns the number of items in
the object.
.SH VALUE
An integer.
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Basic usage
.IP
.EX
\f[B]const\f[R] transform = \f[B]new\f[R] CSSTransformValue([
  \f[B]new\f[R] CSSTranslate(CSS.px(10), CSS.px(20)),
  \f[B]new\f[R] CSSScale(2, 3),
]);

console.log(transform.length); \f[I]// 2\f[R]
.EE
